I tend to put on the first mithril my pet will step on.
Then ditch it for the first studded leather armor.  I
am undecided if leather armor is worth it before getting
a studded leather armor but mithril is plentiful in the
mines.  I'll think about an iron helmet until a elven
leather helmet arrives.  Then I won't switch helmets
until either a helm of brilliance or a wizards hat (sp?)
