> 5) MagicBane is the flat bomb! Pray for it and it will come.

Do NOT pray until you have it.  Praying will ensure it
takes longer.  The only time prayer ever gets you a
weapon is when you are crowned, and wizards get an
excellent spellbook.

> Also
> at some point altar camp and pray for all the spellbooks you ever need.

Lots agree that altar camping is a good idea.  I prefer to
avoid praying until I have not just Magicbane but also a
"good" artifact weapon.  For neutral or chaotic, either of
Firey or Frosty.  For chaotic Stormy, for netural maybe
Vorpy or Mojo.  Only after getting these artifacts do I
switch to prayer.  Then I stop prayer and move on through
the dungeon when I get crowned.  It's my sign that my
altar camping has produced enough results.  Crowning is
to be avoided if you know how to avoid it.

> 6) Eventally you'll need to skill enhance each of every school. You'll
